# L §4.4's list (tally 2.3, #247; C-5): a band's argument isn't on the list, so a window there is the hole naming
# it, where every day of `w` gives one row and `v`'s days give two; a pin gives the row. Before: RUN-DOMAIN a band
# argument window(…).
=== m.tally
model p1
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2020-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit glb "a fund unit"
place kop: holdings glb lives 2000-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
kind lots_in: event certain
  leg units: glb
kind gifts_in: lots_in
  attr bought: date
input kbank: observed
input w: date
input v: date
input d0: date
input n0: int
input n40: int
band tier(d: date): int
def held_a[b in gifts_in]: date = b.bought
def held_b[b in gifts_in]: date = b.bought
def copy_w: date = w
def shifted: date = add_days(w, n0)
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2020-01-01
  w = window(2026-03-02, 2026-03-20) "c"
  v = window(2026-03-25, 2026-04-05) "c"
  d0 = 2026-03-10 "c"
  n0 = 0 "c"
  n40 = 40 "c"
  tier: [2026-01-01, 2026-04-01) = 1
  tier: [2026-04-01, 2027-01-01) = 2
  kbank[k4] = (on: 2023-09-12, kind: gifts_in, leg units from world to kop amount 60 glb, bought: window(2019-03-01, 2019-03-31)) "line 4"
  opening[kop] = 0 glb at 2020-01-01 start "c"
ask band_in: tier(w)
ask band_in_p: tier(w) with w = 2026-03-05
ask band_out: tier(v)
ask band_out_p1: tier(v) with v = 2026-03-25
ask band_out_p2: tier(v) with v = 2026-04-05
ask wd_comp: weekday(add_days(w, n0))
=== expect
band_in: ?"date within window(2026-03-02, 2026-03-20) not precise enough for a band argument" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-01-01
band_in_p: 1
  pinned: w = 2026-03-05
  cut 2026-01-01
band_out: ?"date within window(2026-03-25, 2026-04-05) not precise enough for a band argument" (v)
  unknown day: v
  cut 2026-01-01
band_out_p1: 1
  pinned: v = 2026-03-25
  cut 2026-01-01
band_out_p2: 2
  pinned: v = 2026-04-05
  cut 2026-01-01
wd_comp: ?"date within window(2026-03-02, 2026-03-20) not precise enough for weekday" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-01-01
warning: WARN-UNREAD def copy_w is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def held_a is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def held_b is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def shifted is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d0 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input n40 is read by nothing
